{"seq":3,"slug":"presale-order-state-machine","title":"预售订单状态机与尾款支付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/presale-order-state-machine","wordCount":2400,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"预售订单状态机与尾款支付\">预售订单状态机与尾款支付</h1><p>一笔预售订单在它的一生中会经历比现货订单多得多的状态：定金待付、定金已付、等待生产、尾款待付、尾款已付、待发货、已发货、已完成，再加上取消、超时关单、退款、部分退款、争议冻结等旁支。状态一多，事故就从&quot;逻辑写错&quot;变成&quot;两个合法状态迁移撞在一起&quot;。这一篇给出完整的状态集合与迁移表，然后集中处理预售特有的两个竞态窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>状态机的价值不在于画出一张漂亮的图，而在于<strong>让非法的承载状态无法被表示</strong>。一笔预售订单在同一时刻只应该处于一个主状态，而&quot;定金已付且尾款已付&quot;这类信息应当由主状态推导，而不是作为两个独立布尔字段存在——两个布尔字段会产生四种组合，其中 <code>deposit=true, tail=false</code> 与 <code>deposit=false, tail=true</code> 是不合法的，但它们<strong>可以</strong>被写出来，这就是缺陷的来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; PENDING_DEPOSIT: 创建订单&#10;    PENDING_DEPOSIT --&gt; DEPOSIT_PAID: 定金支付成功&#10;    PENDING_DEPOSIT --&gt; CLOSED: 定金窗口超时/用户取消&#10;    DEPOSIT_PAID --&gt; AWAITING_TAIL: 进入尾款窗口&#10;    DEPOSIT_PAID --&gt; CANCELLED_REFUND: 生产前取消&#10;    AWAITING_TAIL --&gt; TAIL_PAID: 尾款支付成功&#10;    AWAITING_TAIL --&gt; CLOSED_FORFEIT: 尾款窗口关闭(弃付)&#10;    TAIL_PAID --&gt; READY_TO_SHIP: 批次到货且质检通过&#10;    READY_TO_SHIP --&gt; SHIPPED: 出库&#10;    SHIPPED --&gt; COMPLETED: 签收&#10;    SHIPPED --&gt; RETURN_IN_PROGRESS: 售后申请&#10;    RETURN_IN_PROGRESS --&gt; REFUNDED: 退货退款完成&#10;    CLOSED --&gt; [*]&#10;    CLOSED_FORFEIT --&gt; [*]&#10;    CANCELLED_REFUND --&gt; [*]&#10;    REFUNDED --&gt; [*]&#10;    COMPLETED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; PENDING_DEPOSIT: 创建订单\n    PENDING_DEPOSIT --&gt; DEPOSIT_PAID: 定金支付成功\n    PENDING_DEPOSIT --&gt; CLOSED: 定金窗口超时/用户取消\n    DEPOSIT_PAID --&gt; AWAITING_TAIL: 进入尾款窗口\n    DEPOSIT_PAID --&gt; CANCELLED_REFUND: 生产前取消\n    AWAITING_TAIL --&gt; TAIL_PAID: 尾款支付成功\n    AWAITING_TAIL --&gt; CLOSED_FORFEIT: 尾款窗口关闭(弃付)\n    TAIL_PAID --&gt; READY_TO_SHIP: 批次到货且质检通过\n    READY_TO_SHIP --&gt; SHIPPED: 出库\n    SHIPPED --&gt; COMPLETED: 签收\n    SHIPPED --&gt; RETURN_IN_PROGRESS: 售后申请\n    RETURN_IN_PROGRESS --&gt; REFUNDED: 退货退款完成\n    CLOSED --&gt; [*]\n    CLOSED_FORFEIT --&gt; [*]\n    CANCELLED_REFUND --&gt; [*]\n    REFUNDED --&gt; [*]\n    COMPLETED --&gt; [*]</pre><p>状态命名有两条纪律。第一，<strong>终局状态必须唯一可辨识</strong>：<code>CLOSED</code>（未付款关闭）、<code>CLOSED_FORFEIT</code>（弃付没收）、<code>CANCELLED_REFUND</code>（取消退款）、<code>REFUNDED</code>（售后退款）四者都表示&quot;这笔订单结束了&quot;，但资金后果完全不同，必须分开。第二，<strong>状态名里不要出现业务动作的所有细节</strong>：<code>TAIL_PAID</code> 而不是 <code>TAIL_PAID_BY_ALIPAY_ON_2026_10_03</code>，支付方式与时间属于事件属性而非状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迁移表与守卫条件\">迁移表与守卫条件</h2><h3 id=\"显式迁移表\">显式迁移表</h3><p>把迁移写成数据而不是散落的 <code>if</code>，是让状态机可测试的前提。每一条迁移包含源状态、目标状态、触发事件与守卫条件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"迁移表与显式迁移数据\">迁移表与显式迁移数据</h3><p>把迁移写成数据而不是散落的 <code>if</code>，是让状态机可测试的前提。每一条迁移包含源状态、目标状态、触发事件与守卫条件。</p>\n<p>状态机还有一层可借鉴的规范化语义：W3C 的 State Chart XML 规范把状态分为原子态、复合态与并行态，规定复合态同一时刻只有一个子状态活跃，而并行态的<strong>全部</strong>子区域同时活跃但事件仍被串行处理——因此并行模型不需要真正的多线程，也不引入竞态（见 <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/</a> ）。对本场景有直接价值的是它的两个规则：外部迁移在目标是自身复合源的子孙时会退出并重新进入源状态，因而触发源的退出与进入动作；内部迁移则不会。把&quot;资金已发生的事实不可回退&quot;表达成内部迁移而非外部迁移，可以避免一次误写的过渡态触发退款动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>源状态</th>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>守卫</th>\n<th>目标状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PENDING_DEPOSIT</td>\n<td>deposit_paid</td>\n<td>金额匹配且未超时</td>\n<td>DEPOSIT_PAID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PENDING_DEPOSIT</td>\n<td>timeout / cancel</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>CLOSED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEPOSIT_PAID</td>\n<td>tail_window_open</td>\n<td>now ≥ 窗口开始</td>\n<td>AWAITING_TAIL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DEPOSIT_PAID</td>\n<td>cancel_by_user</td>\n<td>未开线且未超撤回期</td>\n<td>CANCELLED_REFUND</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWAITING_TAIL</td>\n<td>tail_paid</td>\n<td>金额匹配且窗口未关</td>\n<td>TAIL_PAID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWAITING_TAIL</td>\n<td>window_closed</td>\n<td>now &gt; 窗口结束</td>\n<td>CLOSED_FORFEIT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TAIL_PAID</td>\n<td>batch_received</td>\n<td>批次收货且质检通过</td>\n<td>READY_TO_SHIP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>READY_TO_SHIP</td>\n<td>shipped</td>\n<td>运单号已生成</td>\n<td>SHIPPED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHIPPED</td>\n<td>delivered</td>\n<td>签收事件到达</td>\n<td>COMPLETED</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHIPPED</td>\n<td>after_sales_request</td>\n<td>在售后窗口内</td>\n<td>RETURN_IN_PROGRESS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE presale_order_state (&#10;  order_id     BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  state        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  version      INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  updated_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_state CHECK (state IN (&#10;    &#39;PENDING_DEPOSIT&#39;,&#39;DEPOSIT_PAID&#39;,&#39;AWAITING_TAIL&#39;,&#39;TAIL_PAID&#39;,&#10;    &#39;READY_TO_SHIP&#39;,&#39;SHIPPED&#39;,&#39;COMPLETED&#39;,&#39;RETURN_IN_PROGRESS&#39;,&#10;    &#39;CLOSED&#39;,&#39;CLOSED_FORFEIT&#39;,&#39;CANCELLED_REFUND&#39;,&#39;REFUNDED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE presale_state_transition (&#10;  transition_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id      BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  from_state    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  to_state      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  trigger_event TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  occurred_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;ALTER TABLE presale_state_transition&#10;  ADD CONSTRAINT uq_transition_from_to&#10;  UNIQUE (order_id, from_state, to_state, trigger_event);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> presale_order_state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'PENDING_DEPOSIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DEPOSIT_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AWAITING_TAIL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TAIL_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'READY_TO_SHIP'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMPLETED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_IN_PROGRESS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'CLOSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CLOSED_FORFEIT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELLED_REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> presale_state_transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  transition_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  from_state    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  to_state      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trigger_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_state_transition</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uq_transition_from_to</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id, from_state, to_state, trigger_event);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"乐观并发与版本号\">乐观并发与版本号</h3><p><code>presale_order_state.version</code> 是防止并发迁移的关键。每次迁移都必须带上读到的版本号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE presale_order_state&#10;SET state = $2,&#10;    version = version + 1,&#10;    updated_at = now()&#10;WHERE order_id = $1&#10;  AND state = $3&#10;  AND version = $4&#10;RETURNING version;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>更新行数为 0 意味着状态已被别的请求改过，本次迁移应当被拒绝并重新读取。这与 PostgreSQL 文档描述的乐观版本检查是同一个模式：用 <code>WHERE ... AND version = $seen_version</code> 更新，若影响 0 行说明其他事务先改了该行，此时应回滚并重试整个事务，而不是只重试失败的那条语句（见 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/mvcc.html\">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/mvcc.html</a> ）。注意 <code>WHERE state = $3</code> 与 <code>WHERE version = $4</code> 两个条件都要带——只带版本号能防并发，但不防&quot;从错误的状态出发&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"尾款窗口的竞态处理\">尾款窗口的竞态处理</h2><h3 id=\"竞态一-支付成功与超时关单\">竞态一：支付成功与超时关单</h3><p>这是预售系统最经典的竞态。用户在窗口关闭的最后一秒点击支付，支付网关的异步回调在两秒后到达，而此时超时关单任务已经把订单置为 <code>CLOSED_FORFEIT</code>。结果是一笔已收款的订单处于&quot;已关闭&quot;状态，用户投诉，退款流程与生产流程都无从下手。</p>\n<p>三种处理方式，可靠性递增：</p>\n<p><strong>方式一：时间戳比较。</strong> 在回调处理时比较 <code>payment.occurred_at</code> 与窗口关闭时间，若支付发生在关闭之前则回滚关单。这依赖支付网关提供的事件时间且时钟可信，脆弱。</p>\n<p><strong>方式二：状态机守卫。</strong> 让超时关单任务的迁移带守卫条件，只在&quot;仍然处于 AWAITING_TAIL 且没有任何进行中的支付意图&quot;时才关单。它需要一个&quot;进行中支付意图&quot;的标记。</p>\n<p><strong>方式三：延迟关单 + 对账。</strong> 让关单任务在窗口关闭后再等待一个安全间隔（覆盖支付网关的最大回调延迟）才执行，并在执行前重新查询支付状态。这个方式把竞态从&quot;服务内部&quot;推到了&quot;服务与支付网关之间&quot;，而后者本来就必须靠对账解决。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant O as 订单服务&#10;    participant P as 支付网关&#10;    participant J as 关单任务&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;P: 最后一秒发起尾款支付&#10;    P--&gt;&gt;O: 回调 tail_paid (延迟2s)&#10;    J-&gt;&gt;O: 尝试迁到 CLOSED_FORFEIT&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: 守卫: 存在进行中支付意图?&#10;    O--&gt;&gt;J: 拒绝迁移&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;O: 迁到 TAIL_PAID&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;P: 对账确认\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant O as 订单服务\n    participant P as 支付网关\n    participant J as 关单任务\n    U-&gt;&gt;P: 最后一秒发起尾款支付\n    P--&gt;&gt;O: 回调 tail_paid (延迟2s)\n    J-&gt;&gt;O: 尝试迁到 CLOSED_FORFEIT\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: 守卫: 存在进行中支付意图?\n    O--&gt;&gt;J: 拒绝迁移\n    O-&gt;&gt;O: 迁到 TAIL_PAID\n    O-&gt;&gt;P: 对账确认</pre><h3 id=\"竞态二-尾款支付与用户取消\">竞态二：尾款支付与用户取消</h3><p>用户在支付进行中点击取消，此时支付可能已经成功。处理原则与上一个竞态相同——<strong>取消请求不能无条件覆盖支付结果</strong>。正确的顺序是：取消请求先写一个 <code>cancel_requested</code> 标记，然后尝试迁移；若此时状态已是 <code>TAIL_PAID</code>，则取消退化为一次退款申请，走 <code>RETURN_IN_PROGRESS</code> 路径，而不是回退状态。</p>\n<p>这条规则的一般形式是：<strong>资金已经发生的事实不能被状态回退抹掉，只能通过一笔反向资金操作对冲。</strong> 把这句话写进状态机的不变式，可以避免大量&quot;状态退了但钱没退&quot;的账实不符。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的构造\">幂等键的构造</h3><p>两个竞态的处理都依赖幂等。幂等键应当由<strong>业务事实</strong>构成而非随机数，这样同一个业务动作无论重放多少次都得到同一个键。推荐的构造是 <code>{order_id}:{event_type}:{payment_intent_id}</code>，其中 <code>payment_intent_id</code> 来自支付网关，天然唯一。用随机 UUID 做键的问题是：重试时生成新的 UUID，幂等失效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>幂等键</th>\n<th>重放效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定金支付</td>\n<td><code>o:{id}:deposit:{pi}</code></td>\n<td>第二次被唯一约束拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾款支付</td>\n<td><code>o:{id}:tail:{pi}</code></td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时关单</td>\n<td><code>o:{id}:timeout:{window_close_at}</code></td>\n<td>窗口固定，键稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消</td>\n<td><code>o:{id}:cancel:{request_id}</code></td>\n<td>需用户级幂等键</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表最后一行需要注意：取消的幂等键必须由客户端提供（<code>request_id</code>），否则用户连续点两次取消会产生两条记录。这与前几行不同——支付和超时的键都能从服务端事实推导，取消不能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分支付与金额校验\">部分支付与金额校验</h2><p>尾款金额的校验不能只比较&quot;是否大于 0&quot;。完整的校验规则是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>paid</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>expected_tail</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>且</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>currency</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>order.currency</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\text{paid} - \\text{expected\\_tail}| \\le \\epsilon \\quad \\text{且} \\quad \\text{currency} = \\text{order.currency}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">paid</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">expected_tail</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">currency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order.currency</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>expected_tail</code> 必须来自下单时持久化的 <code>tail_amount</code>（见 <a href=\"../presale-model/presale-deposit-balance-crowdfunding\">模式图谱</a> 中关于不可重算的说明），而不是在支付时按当前价格重算。<code>epsilon</code> 用于容忍分位币种的四舍五入差异。</p>\n<p>拒绝部分支付的理由很直接：一笔尾款只付了 80%，订单既不能算 <code>TAIL_PAID</code>，用户又已经付了钱。允许部分支付会引入一个&quot;部分尾款&quot;状态，而这个状态在下游（排产、库存）无法被消费。正确的做法是拒绝并要求补足，或按平台规则全额退款后重新下单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态与下游事件的绑定\">状态与下游事件的绑定</h2><p>状态迁移不能只是改一个字段，它必须以<strong>事件</strong>的形式发布给下游。库存预留的确认、排产任务的创建、通知的发送都依赖这些事件。这里的关键是<strong>事务性发件箱</strong>（transactional outbox）：把状态变更与待发事件写在同一个事务里，再由独立的发布者读取并投递。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH moved AS (&#10;  UPDATE presale_order_state&#10;  SET state = &#39;TAIL_PAID&#39;, version = version + 1, updated_at = now()&#10;  WHERE order_id = $1 AND state = &#39;AWAITING_TAIL&#39; AND version = $2&#10;  RETURNING order_id&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO outbox_event (aggregate_type, aggregate_id, event_type, payload, created_at)&#10;SELECT &#39;presale_order&#39;, order_id, &#39;TAIL_PAID&#39;,&#10;       jsonb_build_object(&#39;order_id&#39;, order_id), now()&#10;FROM moved;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> presale_order_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TAIL_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AWAITING_TAIL'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outbox_event (aggregate_type, aggregate_id, event_type, payload, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'presale_order'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TAIL_PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       jsonb_build_object(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> moved;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条语句把&quot;状态迁移&quot;与&quot;事件写入&quot;合并成一个原子操作。<code>WITH ... RETURNING</code> 的写法保证了只有真正发生了迁移才会写入事件——如果乐观锁拒绝（更新 0 行），<code>moved</code> 为空，事件也不会写入。下游消费者只要保证幂等，整套流程就可以安全重放。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>主状态唯一，支付节点由状态推导，不用多个布尔字段组合表示。</li>\n<li>状态机写成迁移数据而非散落的 <code>if</code>，才可测试、可回放、可审计。</li>\n<li>终局状态要区分资金后果：未付款关闭、弃付没收、取消退款、售后退款是四种不同的结束。</li>\n<li>乐观锁必须同时校验 <code>state</code> 与 <code>version</code>，只校验版本不防&quot;从错误状态出发&quot;。</li>\n<li>尾款竞态的首选解法是延迟关单加支付状态复查，把竞态交给对账处理。</li>\n<li>资金已发生的事实不能被状态回退抹掉，只能用反向资金操作对冲。</li>\n<li>幂等键由业务事实构成；取消这类由用户发起的事件需要客户端提供请求 id。</li>\n<li>部分尾款应当被拒绝，部分状态无法被下游消费。</li>\n<li>用事务性发件箱把状态迁移与事件发布变成一次原子写入。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>预留状态如何与订单状态对应，见 <a href=\"presale-inventory-separation-allocation\">预售/现货库存隔离与预留</a>；弃付的度量与预测见 <a href=\"../presale-ops-metric/presale-conversion-deposit-tail\">预售转化、定金转化与弃尾款</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预售订单状态机与尾款支付","id":"预售订单状态机与尾款支付"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移表与守卫条件","id":"迁移表与守卫条件"},{"level":3,"text":"显式迁移表","id":"显式迁移表"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移表与显式迁移数据","id":"迁移表与显式迁移数据"},{"level":3,"text":"乐观并发与版本号","id":"乐观并发与版本号"},{"level":2,"text":"尾款窗口的竞态处理","id":"尾款窗口的竞态处理"},{"level":3,"text":"竞态一：支付成功与超时关单","id":"竞态一-支付成功与超时关单"},{"level":3,"text":"竞态二：尾款支付与用户取消","id":"竞态二-尾款支付与用户取消"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的构造","id":"幂等键的构造"},{"level":2,"text":"部分支付与金额校验","id":"部分支付与金额校验"},{"level":2,"text":"状态与下游事件的绑定","id":"状态与下游事件的绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生产周期与发货承诺（ATP）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/production-leadtime-delivery-promise"},"next":{"title":"达标/stretch goal/未达标退款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund"}}